{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07244","headline":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 疲马 · 刘长卿","name":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 疲马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄黄一疲马，筋力尽胡尘。\n骧首北风夕，徘徊鸣向人。\n谁怜弃置久，欲与驽骀亲。\n犹恋长城外，青青寒草春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}